    Every row is tagged **Dedicated** (per customer) or **Shared** (Spaarke-operated, serves many customers) and states
    whether current code already matches the target or which remediation task (T2xx) closes the gap. The retired
    "shared Model 1 trial/SMB tier" appears only in a short "Retired" section, not as a live option.
  </goal>

